      "content": "idk i feel like it's not that big of a deal honestly. i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now and it doesn't really hurt that bad, just feels tight and heavy. if it's just a strain, can i just take some ibuprofen and keep moving so it doesn't get stiff? i don't want to be stuck on the couch all week.",
